# Web commit / push gates

Before finishing any change under `web/`:

1. Run `corepack pnpm lint:fix` then `corepack pnpm lint` from `web/`
2. Rely on Husky — do not use `git commit --no-verify` or `git push --no-verify` unless the user explicitly requests it
3. Fix biome import order (`type` imports before values) and format errors locally; CI fails on the same checks
4. Read `.cursor/skills/web-quality-gates/SKILL.md` when unsure which gates apply
